","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101291.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-15T00:42:51Z"},"body":"This is a small sanity cleanup to avoid unexpected implicit conversions, which may lead to subtle bugs or inefficiencies.\r\n\r\nThe function was essentially already a bool conversion, but not declared as such.\r\nI first tried removing it and replacing callers with `is_empty`, but it turns out there are quite a few callers to the function. Luckily, they all appear to be happy with `explicit operator bool` too - except a single case, which I changed to an `is_empty` call (which is a better fit anyway).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101291/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101291/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}